WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:46.686 --> 00:01:48.488
I'm getting off at the next stop.

00:01:48.488 --> 00:01:51.252
I want to end it.

00:01:53.927 --> 00:01:57.863
"Ogikubo"

00:01:58.198 --> 00:02:00.723
Ogikubo. Ogikubo.

00:02:02.068 --> 00:02:03.535
Goodbye.

00:02:06.039 --> 00:02:07.808
Wait!

00:02:07.808 --> 00:02:09.400
I want you to have this.

00:02:17.284 --> 00:02:20.151
Let's get married.

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:32.926
"The Chuo Line of Love"

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:40.540
This "Chuo Line of Love" sure is embarrassing.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:44.044
That's why it's so good, Sasami...

00:02:44.044 --> 00:02:46.813
Thank goodness it had a happy ending.

00:02:46.813 --> 00:02:49.907
Love is a many-splendored thing.

00:02:57.757 --> 00:03:00.293
Well, it's over.

00:03:00.293 --> 00:03:05.732
Don't turn it off! The afternoon soap
opera "White Cricket" is about to start!

00:03:05.732 --> 00:03:08.668
Huh? You're gonna watch some more?

00:03:08.668 --> 00:03:15.442
But Mihoshi asked me to tape the
rerun of "Space Police Policeman"...

00:03:15.442 --> 00:03:17.844
"Space Police Policeman"?

00:03:17.844 --> 00:03:21.681
She says that they got
jobs as evil aliens on the show,

00:03:21.681 --> 00:03:23.183
and now she's hooked on it!

00:03:23.183 --> 00:03:26.319
Well, that's too bad! "White Cricket" is on!

00:03:26.319 --> 00:03:32.019
Oh, no! "Wild Samurai
Lone Journey 5" is starting!

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:35.395
Just a minute, Ryoko!

00:03:35.395 --> 00:03:36.463
What?

00:03:36.463 --> 00:03:41.234
How dare you sneak up and change the
channel while someone else is watching!

00:03:41.234 --> 00:03:43.998
It's easy to see what
sort of upbringing you had!

00:03:48.975 --> 00:03:52.712
Stop watching those
god-awful sob stories all the time!

00:03:52.712 --> 00:03:56.978
You're so rude because you
watch all those period dramas!

00:03:58.952 --> 00:04:00.754
What? You want to play video games?

00:04:00.754 --> 00:04:02.881
You can play later! Later!

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:06.092
Why's that, Sis?

00:04:06.092 --> 00:04:09.129
You've noticed something important, Ponta.

00:04:09.129 --> 00:04:13.233
Quick, Washu! Turn it back to
"Wild Samurai Lone Journey 5"!

00:04:13.233 --> 00:04:14.067
Nope.

00:04:14.067 --> 00:04:17.771
I look forward to watching this
"Science for Good Kids" show every week.

00:04:17.771 --> 00:04:22.242
Azaka, I'd like to watch
"Fun Cooking in Three Minutes for Men."

00:04:22.242 --> 00:04:24.611
A warrior displays no
weakness even when starving.

00:04:24.611 --> 00:04:27.147
- Turn it to "White Cricket"!
- "Space Police Policeman"!

00:04:27.147 --> 00:04:28.848
Damn it, Washu!

00:04:28.848 --> 00:04:30.650
All right, all right...

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:35.855
I'll show you the latest invention
of the scientific genius, Washu.

00:04:35.855 --> 00:04:38.153
The Exponential Television!

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:43.797
What? That thing's too small to watch!

00:04:43.797 --> 00:04:46.163
Just watch.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:00.040
You haven't seen anything yet.

00:05:03.583 --> 00:05:09.222
I spliced meiotic DNA from
mitochondria into the TV's central cavity.

00:05:09.222 --> 00:05:11.958
Now, everyone can watch whatever they want.

00:05:11.958 --> 00:05:14.260
You're pretty good when
you put your mind to it, Washu.

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:16.296
You're certainly a genius, all right!

00:05:16.296 --> 00:05:20.289
Call me " Li'I Washu,
Super Genius" from now on, please.

00:05:20.934 --> 00:05:23.169
But...

00:05:23.169 --> 00:05:25.694
Isn't this too many?

00:05:35.915 --> 00:05:37.439
Look out!

00:05:42.722 --> 00:05:43.623
Huh?

00:05:43.623 --> 00:05:45.825
Thank you, Azaka, Kamidake.

00:05:45.825 --> 00:05:50.030
It was nothing. Our duty as
Guardians is to protect you, Princess.

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:54.401
If you are in danger, Princess, we will
come to your aid, wherever you may be.

00:05:54.401 --> 00:05:58.462
Damn it, now I can't watch
"Wild Samurai Lone Journey 5"...

00:06:00.907 --> 00:06:02.772
Hey! Look at that!

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.046
- Tenchi!
- Lord Tenchi!

00:06:06.046 --> 00:06:07.313
Hello, everyone!

00:06:07.313 --> 00:06:10.684
They say that when it's raining
in Tokyo, it's snowing here...

00:06:10.684 --> 00:06:13.853
Get out of the way, you
stupid reporter! I can't see Tenchi!

00:06:13.853 --> 00:06:16.990
These ancient ruins were discovered
here in North Okutama near the fault line...

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:19.526
...caused by the earthquake that
hit these mountains three months ago.

00:06:19.526 --> 00:06:21.628
According to the research team,

00:06:21.628 --> 00:06:22.896
- these ruins are some 3,500 years old.

00:06:22.896 --> 00:06:23.963
- You broke it!
- These ruins are some 3,500 years old.

00:06:23.963 --> 00:06:26.633
- I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
- The basic excavation was completed...

00:06:26.633 --> 00:06:30.036
So, Tenchi's in North Okutama!

00:06:30.036 --> 00:06:32.163
Maybe I'll go pay him a visit...

00:06:33.239 --> 00:06:35.036
- Azaka!
- Yes, Ma'am!

00:06:41.147 --> 00:06:43.249
Hold it right there, you little...

00:06:43.249 --> 00:06:45.285
What the hell?!

00:06:45.285 --> 00:06:48.188
Now Ryoko can't come here!

00:06:48.188 --> 00:06:51.958
And in the meantime,
I'll be on a date with Tenchi!

00:06:51.958 --> 00:06:55.325
Hey! That was dirty, Ayeka!

00:06:59.132 --> 00:07:02.936
Remember, work in teams!

00:07:02.936 --> 00:07:05.572
We're not grade-schoolers, you know!

00:07:05.572 --> 00:07:06.706
Right, Masaki?

00:07:06.706 --> 00:07:07.507
Yeah.

00:07:07.507 --> 00:07:09.476
What's wrong, Sakuya?

00:07:09.476 --> 00:07:11.377
You haven't been yourself lately.

00:07:11.377 --> 00:07:13.413
Yeah, ever since you stayed
home from school a while ago.

00:07:13.413 --> 00:07:14.881
Did something happen?

00:07:14.881 --> 00:07:17.851
Hey, I know! You ate too
much and put on weight!

00:07:17.851 --> 00:07:20.019
That's you.

00:07:20.019 --> 00:07:21.387
You can tell?

00:07:21.387 --> 00:07:25.525
If there's anything we can do,
just tell us. We'll help you out.

00:07:25.525 --> 00:07:27.015
Thanks.

00:07:31.464 --> 00:07:35.068
It's nothing. Really, it's nothing.

00:07:35.068 --> 00:07:36.069
Come on, let's go.

00:07:36.069 --> 00:07:39.139
Hey, Masaki! Masaki!

00:07:39.139 --> 00:07:41.908
Let's get going.
Everybody else has already left.

00:07:41.908 --> 00:07:46.479
Do you think there are any valuables
here that haven't been dug up yet?

00:07:46.479 --> 00:07:49.749
Like some gold
crockery or diamond beads...

00:07:49.749 --> 00:07:52.619
No way, you idiot...

00:07:52.619 --> 00:07:55.850
And anyway, if something's made
out of gold, you don't call it crockery!

00:07:56.656 --> 00:07:59.726
What's up, Masaki? Something wrong?

00:07:59.726 --> 00:08:05.465
I was just wondering what kind of
lives people lived here 3,500 years ago.

00:08:05.465 --> 00:08:07.467
Yeah, you're right...

00:08:07.467 --> 00:08:11.301
<i>3,500 years ago would've been
the Azuchi-Momoyama Period...</i>

00:08:12.405 --> 00:08:15.208
It was the Jomon Period.

00:08:15.208 --> 00:08:18.311
Oh, dear, Umanosuke!

00:08:18.311 --> 00:08:19.979
Man, I can't stand ignorance...

00:08:19.979 --> 00:08:24.882
- Shut up! I did it on purpose so
we could have some fun with it!
- Cut it out, man! Cut it out!

00:08:43.803 --> 00:08:45.972
What the heck happened?

00:08:45.972 --> 00:08:49.703
Where are we? Am I Umanosuke? Yep.

00:08:52.579 --> 00:08:54.206
What the heck is that?

00:09:02.956 --> 00:09:06.492
Looks like people have
snuck into your bedroom.

00:09:06.492 --> 00:09:11.327
It wasn't my bedroom. That was my grave.

00:09:16.703 --> 00:09:20.173
Is this really something
from the Jomon Period?

00:09:20.173 --> 00:09:23.409
I did it! What a big discovery!

00:09:23.409 --> 00:09:29.015
I hereby christen this
place the Shrine of Amagasaki!

00:09:29.015 --> 00:09:32.919
What are you babbling about,
Amagasaki? Face the facts!

00:09:32.919 --> 00:09:37.083
If we're not careful, we're going to
spend the rest of our lives down here!

00:09:40.627 --> 00:09:44.864
The weather sure is nice today,
isn't it, Old Man Tenchi?

00:09:44.864 --> 00:09:48.201
What was that, Old Man Umanosuke?

00:09:48.201 --> 00:09:55.141
Old Man Tenchi, Old Man Umanosuke
said the weather's nice today.

00:09:55.141 --> 00:10:01.774
Oh, he did? I thought he said
that the weather is nice today.

00:10:02.849 --> 00:10:06.785
No way! I don't want that to happen!

00:10:08.688 --> 00:10:14.126
Oh, Lord Tenchi! I'm on my way to
you, here on the Chuo Line of Love!

00:10:17.263 --> 00:10:19.599
Ogikubo. Ogikubo.

00:10:19.599 --> 00:10:21.935
Th-This isn't my stop!

00:10:21.935 --> 00:10:25.371
Wh-What's going on here?!

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:44.157
This is truly a fitting place for the
temple of the Amagasaki Empire...

00:10:44.157 --> 00:10:46.523
I said, face facts, will you?!

00:10:47.894 --> 00:10:49.623
What's that?

00:10:58.638 --> 00:11:02.709
We hereby seal the evil one within.

00:11:02.709 --> 00:11:05.845
May no one approach this place.

00:11:05.845 --> 00:11:09.576
Misfortune to him who
would try to break this seal.

00:11:12.752 --> 00:11:14.921
What the heck was that?

00:11:14.921 --> 00:11:16.522
What is it, Masaki?

00:11:16.522 --> 00:11:18.391
You have a headache?

00:11:18.391 --> 00:11:20.994
N-No. It's nothing.

00:11:20.994 --> 00:11:23.588
What was that that I just saw?

00:11:24.998 --> 00:11:27.667
What? Masaki's missing?

00:11:27.667 --> 00:11:29.502
Tsuchida and Amagasaki, too.

00:11:29.502 --> 00:11:31.604
What?

00:11:31.604 --> 00:11:33.740
They say Masaki and his friends are missing!

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:36.175
I got it! They left to buy something to eat!

00:11:36.175 --> 00:11:38.075
No, that's you.

00:11:39.045 --> 00:11:40.706
Masaki...

00:11:42.148 --> 00:11:44.484
It couldn't be...

00:11:44.484 --> 00:11:47.544
Were they swept away to that
mysterious world I've been hearing about?

00:11:50.156 --> 00:11:51.491
Excuse me...

00:11:51.491 --> 00:11:55.328
Pardon me for asking, but
where might Tenchi Masaki be?

00:11:55.328 --> 00:11:57.730
Huh? Tenchi?

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.899
Mihoshi!

00:11:59.899 --> 00:12:02.493
Ayeka! What are you doing here?

00:12:03.603 --> 00:12:06.094
Those were part of their cultural legacy!

00:12:11.677 --> 00:12:13.880
It's a sarcophagus...

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:16.246
The "evil one" is in there...

00:12:18.117 --> 00:12:19.778
It's broken!

00:12:22.789 --> 00:12:26.192
If that rock hadn't fallen during
that earthquake three months ago,

00:12:26.192 --> 00:12:28.628
I'd still be sleeping in there.

00:12:28.628 --> 00:12:30.329
So... What will you do?

00:12:30.329 --> 00:12:32.131
Nothing.

00:12:32.131 --> 00:12:35.362
There are a couple of
interesting people in there.

00:12:37.103 --> 00:12:40.940
Hey, Masaki... I don't think
it's safe to get that close to it.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.635
I'll be fine.

00:12:43.743 --> 00:12:45.711
I found something great!

00:12:45.711 --> 00:12:49.248
This will make a perfect
throne for the Amagasaki Empire!

00:12:49.248 --> 00:12:52.149
Shall I make you my ministers?

00:12:52.785 --> 00:12:54.353
What a total moron...

00:12:54.353 --> 00:12:56.889
Don't be strangers! Come closer!

00:12:56.889 --> 00:12:58.754
Hey! Amagasaki!

00:13:03.162 --> 00:13:05.858
Azaka? Kamidake?
What are they doing here?!

00:13:08.301 --> 00:13:12.105
It's like you two are
getting smaller and smaller!

00:13:12.105 --> 00:13:15.875
So the instant you become emperor,
your majesty becomes manifest...

00:13:15.875 --> 00:13:19.679
I am the true ruler of the world!

00:13:19.679 --> 00:13:22.615
Stop spouting that garbage
and look under your ass!

00:13:22.615 --> 00:13:24.515
Under my ass?

00:13:28.287 --> 00:13:29.879
What the...

00:13:35.061 --> 00:13:38.431
Seal power of sarcophagus is destroyed.

00:13:38.431 --> 00:13:41.734
The evil one has escaped the Jurai seal!

00:13:41.734 --> 00:13:42.969
Jurai?

00:13:42.969 --> 00:13:45.638
That was made by Juraians?

00:13:45.638 --> 00:13:48.541
Warning. Return to the sarcophagus at once.

00:13:48.541 --> 00:13:50.943
If you do not comply, you will be forced back.

00:13:50.943 --> 00:13:53.412
What the heck are they talking about?

00:13:53.412 --> 00:13:55.437
Very well, leave this to me.

00:13:56.315 --> 00:13:58.146
Hey, Amagasaki!

00:14:03.656 --> 00:14:08.728
You... and I... are friends! Friends!

00:14:08.728 --> 00:14:10.429
Cannot comprehend. Cannot comprehend.

00:14:10.429 --> 00:14:13.523
Actions determined to be dangerous.
Now going to offensive mode.

00:14:19.071 --> 00:14:21.507
Lord Tenchi! Where are you?

00:14:21.507 --> 00:14:25.444
- Tenchi!
- Tenchi!

00:14:25.444 --> 00:14:29.916
But how could they be
missing in a place like this?

00:14:29.916 --> 00:14:32.952
Do you think they fell
down a hole or something?

00:14:32.952 --> 00:14:34.654
Only you could pull off something like that.

00:14:34.654 --> 00:14:37.557
That's so mean!
Just because I'm a little clumsy...

00:14:37.557 --> 00:14:40.826
...doesn't mean I trip over everything!

00:14:40.826 --> 00:14:42.691
I'm falling!

00:14:46.098 --> 00:14:48.532
- Mommy!
- I'm too young to die!

00:14:53.506 --> 00:14:55.497
It's a dead end!

00:14:57.543 --> 00:15:00.413
This is your final <i>warning:</i>
Return to the sarcophagus at once.

00:15:00.413 --> 00:15:03.983
Why do we have to get into a sarcophagus?!

00:15:03.983 --> 00:15:08.154
They think we're whoever it
was who was in that sarcophagus!

00:15:08.154 --> 00:15:10.089
Are you morons or something?

00:15:10.089 --> 00:15:12.523
Statement determined to be
rejection of warning. Will now terminate.

00:15:21.467 --> 00:15:23.903
Ayeka!

00:15:23.903 --> 00:15:27.440
L-Lord Tenchi! I finally found you!

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:29.408
And it's all thanks to me!

00:15:29.408 --> 00:15:31.210
Thanks to your clumsiness, you mean.

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:33.112
Stop being so mean!

00:15:33.112 --> 00:15:37.450
Wow! It's just like Wargon's secret base!

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:38.651
Who?

00:15:38.651 --> 00:15:42.989
The bad guy in Space Police Policeman!

00:15:42.989 --> 00:15:45.558
He has an underground hideout like this.

00:15:45.558 --> 00:15:47.460
You watch too much TV.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:50.363
The fugitives' accomplices have appeared!

00:15:50.363 --> 00:15:54.533
Probability of escape has increased.
Begin contingency plan at once.

00:15:54.533 --> 00:15:56.364
Those are Guardians!

00:15:59.772 --> 00:16:02.642
I am Ayeka, First Princess of Jurai!

00:16:02.642 --> 00:16:04.877
How dare you point your weapons at me,

00:16:04.877 --> 00:16:07.573
a member of the
legitimate royal family of Jurai?

00:16:11.751 --> 00:16:13.686
Bio-scan complete.

00:16:13.686 --> 00:16:17.123
Identity of First Princess
of Jurai has been confirmed.

00:16:17.123 --> 00:16:19.191
Then leave us!

00:16:19.191 --> 00:16:20.783
- Yes, Ma'am!
- Yes, Ma'am!

00:16:22.795 --> 00:16:24.630
Thanks, Ayeka.

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:28.334
It was nothing. I'd do
anything for you, Lord Tenchi.

00:16:28.334 --> 00:16:33.072
But why are two Guardians here?
Especially such old types?

00:16:33.072 --> 00:16:35.165
And look at that, Ayeka!

00:16:37.009 --> 00:16:39.645
That's a Juraian Seal Temple!

00:16:39.645 --> 00:16:42.081
Oh, dear. Is it over already?

00:16:42.081 --> 00:16:44.350
This is no fun.

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:48.321
But that's to be expected
when a royal Juraian shows up.

00:16:48.321 --> 00:16:49.811
However...

00:16:52.391 --> 00:16:56.088
They sure look like Azaka and Kamidake...

00:17:01.167 --> 00:17:03.727
Terminate! Terminate! Terminate! Terminate!

00:17:05.037 --> 00:17:06.839
What did they say?

00:17:06.839 --> 00:17:08.441
Terminate! Terminate! Terminate! Terminate!

00:17:08.441 --> 00:17:09.775
Terminate! Terminate!

00:17:09.775 --> 00:17:11.577
Wh-What's going on?!

00:17:11.577 --> 00:17:15.281
Did you do something to make them mad?!

00:17:15.281 --> 00:17:18.045
- I didn't do anything!
- Terminate! Terminate! Terminate!

00:17:19.318 --> 00:17:22.488
Stop this! I'm a member of the
legitimate royal family of Jurai!

00:17:22.488 --> 00:17:24.056
Terminate! Terminate! Terminate!

00:17:24.056 --> 00:17:27.760
What?! How can a
Guardian not obey my orders?!

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:29.829
Mihoshi! Return fire!

00:17:29.829 --> 00:17:30.963
Terminate! Terminate! Terminate!

00:17:30.963 --> 00:17:32.865
Terminate! Terminate! Terminate! Terminate!

00:17:32.865 --> 00:17:36.435
Kiyone, I didn't bring my gun with me...

00:17:36.435 --> 00:17:38.070
What?!

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:40.561
Terminate! Terminate! Terminate!
Terminate! Terminate! Terminate!

00:17:42.041 --> 00:17:44.839
What do you think you're doing to my Tenchi?!

00:17:46.612 --> 00:17:47.947
You did it!

00:17:47.947 --> 00:17:49.515
That was amazing, Ayeka!

00:17:49.515 --> 00:17:52.218
Terminate! Terminate!
Terminate! Terminate! Terminate!

00:17:52.218 --> 00:17:53.819
Terminate!

00:17:53.819 --> 00:17:55.480
Terminate! Terminate! Terminate!

00:17:56.355 --> 00:17:58.186
Ayeka!

00:17:59.258 --> 00:18:00.526
Kamidake!

00:18:00.526 --> 00:18:01.894
Azaka!

00:18:01.894 --> 00:18:03.796
Ready!

00:18:03.796 --> 00:18:05.661
Let's go!

00:18:12.905 --> 00:18:14.668
Ayeka!

00:18:21.647 --> 00:18:23.638
Terminate! Terminate! Terminate! Terminate!

00:18:24.884 --> 00:18:27.580
I can't... hold it...

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:30.089
Here we go!

00:18:30.089 --> 00:18:31.852
Damn it...

00:18:32.658 --> 00:18:36.195
Lord... Tenchi...

00:18:36.195 --> 00:18:38.527
Ayeka!

00:18:52.044 --> 00:18:53.944
Here we are!

00:18:57.049 --> 00:18:59.051
Azaka! Kamidake!

00:18:59.051 --> 00:19:01.287
You came for me?

00:19:01.287 --> 00:19:03.923
It is our duty to protect you, Princess.

00:19:03.923 --> 00:19:09.161
If you are in danger, Princess, we will
come to your aid, no matter where you are.

00:19:09.161 --> 00:19:11.530
- Terminate! Terminate!
- Terminate!

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:13.032
Kamidake! Let's go!

00:19:13.032 --> 00:19:13.966
Right!

00:19:13.966 --> 00:19:15.334
- Terminate!
- Terminate!

00:19:15.334 --> 00:19:17.131
Take this!

00:19:17.369 --> 00:19:21.066
- Terminate! Terminate! Terminate!
- Take this! Take this! And this!

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.709
- Terminate!
- Take this!

00:19:23.709 --> 00:19:28.080
It's like it's just a bunch
of logs hitting each other...

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:31.951
After that great entrance they
made, this fight sure is a letdown.

00:19:31.951 --> 00:19:32.618
Why, you...

00:19:32.618 --> 00:19:33.986
- Terminate!
- Take this!

00:19:33.986 --> 00:19:36.755
Azaka! Kamidake! Finish this!

00:19:36.755 --> 00:19:38.154
- Yes, Ma'am!
- Yes, Ma'am!

00:19:40.793 --> 00:19:42.228
Let's do it!

00:19:42.228 --> 00:19:43.695
- Yes, Ma'am!
- Yes, Ma'am!

00:19:45.598 --> 00:19:48.801
Wow! It's just like Policeman's final attack!

00:19:48.801 --> 00:19:51.292
Would you just drop it?

00:20:03.282 --> 00:20:06.986
This is the work of our
homeland, Jurai, all right.

00:20:06.986 --> 00:20:07.920
Yes.

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:09.855
But why?

00:20:09.855 --> 00:20:16.028
I don't know... But someone
was once sealed here.

00:20:16.028 --> 00:20:18.588
Sealed here by Juraians.

00:20:20.132 --> 00:20:26.435
What came here to Earth
from Jurai 3,500 years ago?

00:20:31.076 --> 00:20:34.847
What the hell were you
people doing all this time?

00:20:34.847 --> 00:20:39.818
Like I said, the palace of the
Amagasaki Empire is down there...

00:20:39.818 --> 00:20:43.618
If you're gonna lie about it, come
up with something better, you idiot!

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:46.358
That was fun.

00:20:46.358 --> 00:20:49.094
Did that bring up any bad memories?

00:20:49.094 --> 00:20:51.153
Maybe.

00:20:52.698 --> 00:20:56.535
I want to bring my castle
out into the open soon...

00:20:56.535 --> 00:21:00.801
But there's a lot to be
done before I can do that.

00:21:35.741 --> 00:21:39.345
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.345 --> 00:21:43.248
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.248 --> 00:21:46.852
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:46.852 --> 00:21:50.789
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:50.789 --> 00:21:54.293
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.293 --> 00:21:58.263
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.263 --> 00:22:01.600
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:05.604
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:05.604 --> 00:22:07.740
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:07.740 --> 00:22:09.675
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:09.675 --> 00:22:11.176
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:11.176 --> 00:22:17.016
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.016 --> 00:22:21.120
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:24.390
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:24.390 --> 00:22:27.926
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:27.926 --> 00:22:32.625
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:44.677 --> 00:22:46.712
Yo, Ryoko here.

00:22:46.712 --> 00:22:50.649
Hey, Tenchi, with makeup on,
I look really feminine!

00:22:50.649 --> 00:22:53.018
This face makes babies stop crying!

00:22:53.018 --> 00:22:54.920
What do you think? Sounds pretty good, huh?

00:22:54.920 --> 00:22:57.956
Wanna see? You wanna, right?
You wanna see, don't you?

00:22:57.956 --> 00:23:00.759
Okay, I'll show you on our date tomorrow!

00:23:00.759 --> 00:23:04.196
Don't pass out from the shock, okay?

00:23:04.196 --> 00:23:09.862
Next time on <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i>
"Ryoko's Big Date."
